eb",11,29,11,29]]},{"text":"Pharaoh and his host destroyed. — Ex 14:23-28; Ps 106:11.","refs":[["Exod",14,23,14,28],["Ps",106,11,106,11]]},{"text":"Israel’s song of praise. — Ex 15:1-21; Ps 106:12.","refs":[["Exod",15,1,15,21],["Ps",106,12,106,12]]},{"text":"Through the wilderness of Shur or Etham — Ex 15:22; Nu 33:8.","refs":[["Exod",15,22,15,22],["Num",33,8,33,8]]},{"text":"To Marah — Ex 15:23; Nu 33:8.","refs":[["Exod",15,23,15,23],["Num",33,8,33,8]]},{"text":"Murmuring of the people on account of bitter water. — Ex 15:24.","refs":[["Exod",15,24,15,24]]},{"text":"Water sweetened. — Ex 15:25.","refs":[["Exod",15,25,15,25]]},{"text":"To Elim — Ex 15:27; Nu 33:9.","refs":[["Exod",15,27,15,27],["Num",33,9,33,9]]},{"text":"By the Red Sea — Nu 33:10.","refs":[["Num",33,10,33,10]]},{"text":"Through the wilderness of Sin — Ex 16:1; Nu 33:11.","refs":[["Exod",16,1,16,1],["Num",33,11,33,11]]},{"text":"Murmuring for bread. — Ex 16:2,3.","refs":[["Exod",16,2,16,2],["Exod",16,3,16,3]]},{"text":"Quails given for one night. — Ex 16:8,12,13.","refs":[["Exod",16,8,16,8],["Exod",16,12,16,12],["Exod",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Manna sent. — Ex 16:4,8,16-31.","refs":[["Exod",16,4,16,4],["Exod",16,8,16,8],["Exod",16,16,16,31]]},{"text":"To Dophkah — Nu 33:12.","refs":[["Num",33,12,33,12]]},{"text":"To Alush — Nu 33:13.","refs":[["Num",33,13,33,13]]},{"text":"To Rephidim — Ex 17:1; Nu 33:14.","refs":[["Exod",17,1,17,1],["Num",33,14,33,14]]},{"text":"Murmuring for water. — Ex 17:2,3.","refs":[["Exod",17,2,17,2],["Exod",17,3,17,3]]},{"text":"Water brought from the rock. — Ex 17:5,6.","refs":[["Exod",17,5,17,5],["Exod",17,6,17,6]]},{"text":"Called Massah and Meribah. — Ex 17:7.","refs":[["Exod",17,7,17,7]]},{"text":"Amalek opposes Israel. — Ex 17:8.","refs":[["Exod",17,8,17,8]]},{"text":"Amalek overcome. — Ex 17:9-13.","refs":[["Exod",17,9,17,13]]},{"text":"To Mount Sinai — Ex 19:1,2; Nu 33:15.","refs":[["Exod",19,1,19,1],["Exod",19,2,19,2],["Num",33,15,33,15]]},{"text":"Jethro’s visit. — Ex 18:1-6.","refs":[["Exod",18,1,18,6]]},{"text":"Judges appointed. — Ex 18:14-26; De 1:9-15.","refs":[["Exod",18,14,18,26],["Deut",1,9,1,15]]},{"text":"Moral law given. — Ex 19:3; 20:1-26.","refs":[["Exod",19,3,19,3],["Exod",20,1,20,26]]},{"text":"Covenant made. — Ex 24:3-8.","refs":[["Exod",24,3,24,8]]},{"text":"Moral law written on tables. — Ex 31:18.","refs":[["Exod",31,18,31,18]]},{"text":"Order for making the tabernacle, &c. — Ex 24:1-27:21.","refs":[["Exod",24,1,27,21]]},{"text":"Tribe of Levi taken instead of the first-born. — Nu 3:11-13.","refs":[["Num",3,11,3,13]]},{"text":"Aaron and his sons selected for priesthood. — Ex 28:1-29:46; Nu 3:1-3,10.","refs":[["Exod",28,1,29,46],["Num",3,1,3,3],["Num",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Levites set apart. — Nu 3:5-9.","refs":[["Num",3,5,3,9]]},{"text":"Golden calf made. — Ex 32:1,4.","refs":[["Exod",32,1,32,1],["Exod",32,4,32,4]]},{"text":"Tables of testimony broken. — Ex 32:19.","refs":[["Exod",32,19,32,19]]},{"text":"People punished for idolatry. — Ex 32:25-29,35.","refs":[["Exod",32,25,32,29],["Exod",32,35,32,35]]},{"text":"God’s glory shown to Moses. — Ex 33:18-23; 34:5-8.","refs":[["Exod",33,18,33,23],["Exod",34,5,34,8]]},{"text":"The tables of testimony renewed. — Ex 34:1-4,27-29; De 10:1-5.","refs":[["Exod",34,1,34,4],["Exod",34,27,34,29],["Deut",10,1,10,5]]},{"text":"Tabernacle first set up. — Ex 40:1-38.","refs":[["Exod",40,1,40,38]]},{"text":"Nadab and Abihu destroyed for offering strange fire. — Le 10:1,2; Nu 3:4.","refs":[["Lev",10,1,10,1],["Lev",10,2,10,2],["Num",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Passover first commemorated. — Nu 9:1-5.","refs":[["Num",9,1,9,5]]},{"text":"Second numbering of the people. — Nu 1:1-46; Ex 38:25,26.","refs":[["Num",1,1,1,46],["Exod",38,25,38,25],["Exod",38,26,38,26]]},{"text":"To Kibrothhattaavah — Nu 33:16.","refs":[["Num",33,16,33,16]]},{"text":"Complaining punished by fire. — Nu 11:1-3.","refs":[["Num",11,1,11,3]]},{"text":"Called Taberah. — Nu 11:3.","refs":[["Num",11,3,11,3]]},{"text":"Murmuring of the mixed multitude and of Israel, for flesh. — Nu 11:4-9.","refs":[["Num",11,4,11,9]]},{"text":"Flesh promised. — Nu 11:10-15,18-23.","refs":[["Num",11,10,11,15],["Num",11,18,11,23]]},{"text":"Seventy elders appointed to assist Moses. — Nu 11:16,17,24-30.","refs":[["Num",11,16,11,16],["Num",11,17,11,17],["Num",11,24,11,30]]},{"text":"Quails sent for a month. — Nu 11:19,20,31,32.","refs":[["Num",11,19,11,19],["Num",11,20,11,20],["Num",11,31,11,31],["Num",11,32,11,32]]},{"text":"Their murmuring punished. — Nu 11:33; Ps 78:30,31.","refs":[["Num",11,33,11,33],["Ps",78,30,78,30],["Ps",78,31,78,31]]},{"text":"Why called Kibrothhattaavah. — Nu 11:34.","refs":[["Num",11,34,11,34]]},{"text":"To Hazeroth — Nu 11:35; 33:17.","refs":[["Num",11,35,11,35],["Num",33,17,33,17]]},{"text":"Aaron and Miriam envy Moses. — Nu 12:1,2.","refs":[["Num",12,1,12,1],["Num",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Miriam punished by leprosy. — Nu 12:10.","refs":[["Num",12,10,12,10]]},{"text":"Delayed seven day for Miriam. — Nu 12:14,15.","refs":[["Num",12,14,12,14],["Num",12,15,12,15]]},{"text":"To Kadeshbarnea in wilderness of Rithmah or Paran — De 1:19; Nu 32:8; 12:16; 33:18.","refs":[["Deut",1,19,1,19],["Num",32,8,32,8],["Num",12,16,12,16],["Num",33,18,33,18]]},{"text":"The people anxious to have the land of Canaan searched. — De 1:22.","refs":[["Deut",1,22,1,22]]},{"text":"Moses commanded to send spies. — Nu 13:1,2.","refs":[["Num",13,1,13,1],["Num",13,2,13,2]]},{"text":"Persons selected as spies. — Nu 13:3-16.","refs":[["Num",13,3,13,16]]},{"text":"Spies sent. — Jos 14:7; Nu 13:17-20.","refs":[["Josh",14,7,14,7],["Num",13,17,13,20]]},{"text":"Spies bring back evil report. — Nu 13:26-33.","refs":[["Num",13,26,13,33]]},{"text":"The people terrified and rebel. — Nu 14:1-4.","refs":[["Num",14,1,14,4]]},{"text":"Punishment for rebellion. — Nu 14:26,35; 32:11-13; De 1:35,36,40.","refs":[["Num",14,26,14,26],["Num",14,35,14,35],["Num",32,11,32,13],["Deut",1,35,1,35],["Deut",1,36,1,36],["Deut",1,40,1,40]]},