xt":"Orders given respecting Moab. — De 2:8,9.","refs":[["Deut",2,8,2,8],["Deut",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"TO ZARED OR DIBON-GAD — Nu 21:12; 33:45.","refs":[["Num",21,12,21,12],["Num",33,45,33,45]]},{"text":"To Almondiblathaim — Nu 33:46.","refs":[["Num",33,46,33,46]]},{"text":"Across the brook Zered — De 2:13.","refs":[["Deut",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Time occupied in going from Kadeshbarnea to this station. — De 2:14.","refs":[["Deut",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Order to pass through Ar. — De 2:18.","refs":[["Deut",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Orders given respecting Ammon. — De 2:19.","refs":[["Deut",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Across the arnon — Nu 21:13-15; De 2:24.","refs":[["Num",21,13,21,15],["Deut",2,24,2,24]]},{"text":"To beer or the well — Nu 21:16.","refs":[["Num",21,16,21,16]]},{"text":"To Mattanah — Nu 21:18.","refs":[["Num",21,18,21,18]]},{"text":"To Nahaliel — Nu 21:19.","refs":[["Num",21,19,21,19]]},{"text":"To Bamoth — Nu 21:19.","refs":[["Num",21,19,21,19]]},{"text":"To the mountains of Abarim — Nu 21:20; 33:47.","refs":[["Num",21,20,21,20],["Num",33,47,33,47]]},{"text":"The Amorites refuse a passage to Israel. — Nu 21:21-23; De 2:26-30.","refs":[["Num",21,21,21,23],["Deut",2,26,2,30]]},{"text":"Sihon conquered. — Nu 21:23-32; De 2:32-36.","refs":[["Num",21,23,21,32],["Deut",2,32,2,36]]},{"text":"Og conquered. — Nu 21:33-35; De 3:1-11.","refs":[["Num",21,33,21,35],["Deut",3,1,3,11]]},{"text":"Reubenites, &c obtained the land taken from the Amorites. — Nu 32:1-42; De 3:12-17.","refs":[["Num",32,1,32,42],["Deut",3,12,3,17]]},{"text":"Return to the plains of Moab — Nu 22:1; 33:48,49.","refs":[["Num",22,1,22,1],["Num",33,48,33,48],["Num",33,49,33,49]]},{"text":"Balak sends for Balaam. — Nu 22:5,6,15-17.","refs":[["Num",22,5,22,5],["Num",22,6,22,6],["Num",22,15,22,17]]},{"text":"Balaam not permitted to curse Israel. — Nu 22:9-41; 23:1-24:25.","refs":[["Num",22,9,22,41],["Num",23,1,24,25]]},{"text":"Israel seduced to idolatry, &c by advice of Balaam. — Nu 25:1-3; Re 2:14.","refs":[["Num",25,1,25,3],["Rev",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Israel punished. — Nu 25:5,9.","refs":[["Num",25,5,25,5],["Num",25,9,25,9]]},{"text":"Third numbering. — Nu 26:1-62.","refs":[["Num",26,1,26,62]]},{"text":"All formerly numbered over twenty years old, except Caleb and Joshua, dead. — Nu 26:63-65; 14:29.","refs":[["Num",26,63,26,65],["Num",14,29,14,29]]},{"text":"The law of female inheritance settled. — Nu 27:1-11; 36:1-9.","refs":[["Num",27,1,27,11],["Num",36,1,36,9]]},{"text":"Appointment of Joshua. — Nu 27:15-23.","refs":[["Num",27,15,27,23]]},{"text":"Midianites destroyed and Balaam slain. — Nu 31:1-54; 25:17,18.","refs":[["Num",31,1,31,54],["Num",25,17,25,17],["Num",25,18,25,18]]},{"text":"The law rehearsed. — De 1:3.","refs":[["Deut",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"The law written by Moses. — De 31:9.","refs":[["Deut",31,9,31,9]]},{"text":"Moses beholds Canaan. — De 34:1-4.","refs":[["Deut",34,1,34,4]]},{"text":"Moses dies and is buried. — De 34:5,6.","refs":[["Deut",34,5,34,5],["Deut",34,6,34,6]]},{"text":"Joshua ordered to cross Jordan. — Jos 1:2.","refs":[["Josh",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Two spies sent to Jericho. — Jos 2:1.","refs":[["Josh",2,1,2,1]]},{"text":"Across the river Jordan — Jos 4:10.","refs":[["Josh",4,10,4,10]]},{"text":"Illustrative of the pilgrimage of the church — Song 8:5; 1Pe 1:17.","refs":[["Song",8,5,8,5],["1Pet",1,17,1,17]]}],"refCount":307}
